    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "ZORR_SECURITY_R02 / issue #235.\n\nClean candidate after verified TDD RED on PR #236. Root cause: SHERIFF compose silently accepted fallback credentials when required secret environment variables were missing. This candidate keeps existing SHERIFF V1 architecture and changes only the secret boundary plus CI/runtime-e2e test plumbing.\n\nRED evidence: PR #236 head b7bc444e17086906abc73bb5690778ed593b5b5f; hq-validate run 33392005077 / hq-schema job 99487596671; full 281-test suite failed specifically on NATS_PASSWORD, SHERIFF_DB_PASSWORD, and GRAFANA_ADMIN_PASSWORD fallback behavior.\n\nCandidate behavior: required `${VAR:?required}` interpolation for SHERIFF security credentials; explicit ephemeral CI-only values in validation/e2e workflows; dedicated regression test. No merge, no canon change, no production activation, no new runner/framework, no credential rotation.",
